WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.240
Have you ever seen something you weren’t supposed&nbsp;
to? Something that made you feel… off. Something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.080
you regret? Secrets like these are best kept&nbsp;
to yourself, but since you’re still alive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:16.240
whatever you saw wasn’t nearly as&nbsp;
bad as what Peter Holland saw one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:23.200
fateful night in January of 2015. Peter&nbsp;
was an unremarkable man - an office-worker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.000
slaving away at the daily grind. And like&nbsp;
a lot of people, Peter enjoyed nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.440
more than coming home after a long, hard&nbsp;
day, kicking back, and watching some TV.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:40.240
It was this innocent activity that led to&nbsp;
Peter’s horrifying brush with SCP - 5049,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:44.640
altering the course of his&nbsp;
otherwise average life forever.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:50.480
The event started at around 10:05 PM. Peter&nbsp;
was channel surfing, glued to the couch in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:56.960
his sparsely-furnished apartment. Commercials,&nbsp;
commercials, commercials - as far as Peter’s tired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.840
eyes could see. He paused for a moment to&nbsp;
watch the end of an ad for a car he could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:07.200
never hope to afford on his salary, but something&nbsp;
stopped him from changing the channel again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:12.800
The next ad had begun, and it was playing a&nbsp;
strange, scratchy jingle that gave Peter an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:18.160
odd sense of unease. But even stranger&nbsp;
than that was the text on screen:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:24.240
“Demon Dan's Discount Homunculus&nbsp;
Depot”, in baby-blue bubble lettering.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.360
He forced a smile. This had to be some weird&nbsp;
comedy skit, or a viral marketing campaign,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:35.760
or maybe it was something he drank. But no,&nbsp;
this was a real commercial - and things were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:42.880
about to get even weirder. The peppy logo faded&nbsp;
to a concerning sight: A tall, humanoid figure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:50.240
dressed like a used car salesman, but one that&nbsp;
definitely wasn’t human. His skin was dark green,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:57.200
and covered in patches of thick fur. He had long&nbsp;
fingers with intimidating claws, and a grin full&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:05.920
of needle-like fangs. It looked almost...demonic.&nbsp;
And after a few seconds the demon began to speak.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:09.520
“Hey there folks! It's your man, Demon Dan, coming&nbsp;
at you with all the latest and greatest deals from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.920
Demon Dan's Discount Homunculus Depot! We just&nbsp;
accepted a shipment of brand-new models that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:18.480
would make even the most discerning customers&nbsp;
weep with excitement. Let's see what we got…”

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:23.120
The creature - apparently named Demon&nbsp;
Dan - stepped away from his desk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:30.000
revealing two long, furry goat legs that ended&nbsp;
in large, pointed hooves. Peter now assumed he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.200
really was going crazy, but at this point he was&nbsp;
along for the ride. Demon Dan continued his pitch.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.080
“Looking to make your way through the&nbsp;
capitalist hell-scape that makes home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:43.360
look cozy? Come try on one of&nbsp;
the newest businessman models!”

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:48.800
Dan gestured behind him to where Peter was&nbsp;
horrified to see a total of fifty-two adult&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:53.760
male human bodies hanging from a wall.&nbsp;
There was something uncanny about them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:59.600
They seemed almost hollow, like a highly&nbsp;
realistic costume or a prop from a horror movie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.840
Peter didn’t have much time to think&nbsp;
about it though as Demon Dan went on.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.240
“If you’re looking for the extra&nbsp;
challenge of inequality– the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.280
businesswomen model may be the right fit for you!”

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:15.360
The commercial then revealed a wall of human&nbsp;
female bodies strung up in a similar fashion.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:19.920
“Now, maybe you're thinking, "But Dan, business&nbsp;
sounds hard. I just want to have some fun!"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.400
and the fine team here at Demon Dan's Discount&nbsp;
Homunculus Depot have got you covered!”

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:29.200
The camera zoomed out to show an area of the&nbsp;
store filled with children’s decorations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:34.320
and more of these strange, hollowed-out&nbsp;
human suits in child sizes to match.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:37.840
“And who has more fun than kids? No&nbsp;
one, that's who. For a limited time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.200
the purchase of any child-sized&nbsp;
unit comes with a complimentary 50%&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.760
off coupon for parental units! You&nbsp;
just can't say no to a deal like that.”

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.600
Before Peter could process the&nbsp;
madness that was unfolding before him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:54.240
the camera cut again. The store’s&nbsp;
logo appeared on the screen once more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:58.560
along with several cuts to locations&nbsp;
around the store itself. There were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:05.360
more human bodies. Hundreds of them. Demon&nbsp;
Dan’s sleazy voice rang out over all of it.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.760
“Here at Demon Dan's Discount Homunculus&nbsp;
Depot, we know it's not all fun and games.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:13.600
The bravest among us have a mission&nbsp;
to accomplish. The Seven-Lords are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.680
ever planning their invasion, after all,&nbsp;
so you're looking for function over form.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:21.440
Well, we've got that in spades down here&nbsp;
in the tactical services department!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:25.920
You'll be kickin' ass in no time when you're&nbsp;
wearing the latest models at the best prices!”

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:32.240
Seven lords? Invasion? What did any of this&nbsp;
mean? Suddenly, the camera was showing him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:38.080
a new room. Red curtains parted, revealing&nbsp;
more of these person-suits, several bearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:44.640
a striking resemblance to real human celebrities.&nbsp;
He managed to make out Gucci Mane, Avril Lavigne,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:50.560
Paul McCartney, and Britney Spears before Demon&nbsp;
Dan’s appearance once again drew his attention.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.920
“I've got a special treat for you;&nbsp;
we are happy to announce the VIP&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:58.400
lookalike department! We all know how&nbsp;
difficult the creation of homunculus is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:03.200
it's a fine art that takes years of practice.&nbsp;
So, when a replacement order on VIP's comes in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:07.520
every detail needs to be perfect–&nbsp;
unfortunately, that's not always the case.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:12.880
But for the right price, you too can look&nbsp;
like famous icons from around the globe!”

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:17.520
The image of celebrity bodies faded from&nbsp;
view, and Peter was left looking at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:23.920
grinning Demon Dan standing behind the front&nbsp;
desk of his impossible store once more. He said…

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.000
“There ya’ have it folks, come on down&nbsp;
to Demon Dan's Discount Homunculus Depot!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.520
If you're viewing the advertisement, then&nbsp;
you've been selected for entry– please enter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:36.720
the nearest door for instant deals and upgrade&nbsp;
those old duds for one of our newest models!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:38.640
What are you waiting for? Come on down!”

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:46.240
The logo popped up again, hovering above some bold&nbsp;
text that said, “Please Enter The Nearest Door!”

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:51.680
Peter had had enough. He switched off the TV.&nbsp;
What a horror show, he thought. They should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:56.160
warn you before they put short horror films on&nbsp;
TV like that. He had no idea they could just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:01.920
slip them in among regular commercials. Surely&nbsp;
Demon Dan and his store couldn’t be real, right?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:08.000
But as his eyes drifted to the door in his&nbsp;
room, he didn’t feel quite so certain. Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:14.160
there was only one way to find out. Peter got&nbsp;
up, went over to the door, took a deep breath,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.080
and walked through it.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:21.200
Peter Holland was never seen&nbsp;
again. Not as himself, anyway.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:28.480
The SCP Foundation has long been aware of this&nbsp;
sinister transmission - known as SCP - 5049-2 -&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:33.600
and luckily has found ways to prevent it from&nbsp;
claiming more victims. The Foundation Television&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:39.520
Analysis Department as well as WebCrawler 40Y40&nbsp;
- which is the software the Foundation uses to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:44.960
root out anomalous activity online - are always&nbsp;
vigilant for signs of Demon Dan’s commercial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:52.320
running. Just observing Demon Dan, who is himself&nbsp;
classified as SCP - 5049 - A, and his ads puts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.320 --> 00:07:00.160
you in immediate danger, as it can transform&nbsp;
any nearby doors into SCP - 5049-1’s. Those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:05.440
are interdimensional portals that remain active&nbsp;
for around fifteen minutes after viewing the ad.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:11.840
So then what specifically is SCP - 5049? It’s&nbsp;
the entire pocket dimension known as Demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:17.600
Dan’s Discount Homunculus Depot. A Keter-Class&nbsp;
spatial anomaly constantly on the lookout for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:22.880
new human victims, which it transforms&nbsp;
into fleshy suits for its demonic clients&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:27.920
which let them blend in around humans.&nbsp;
Prior to its discovery by the Foundation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:33.360
it’s likely that Demon Dan and his associates&nbsp;
claimed hundreds if not thousands of lives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:38.640
But sadly, even discovering this anomaly&nbsp;
came at a gruesome cost to the Foundation.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:44.000
On February 16th, 2020, the ad played on&nbsp;
Safe Storage Warehouse-13's break room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.640
television. At the time of the broadcast,&nbsp;
four Foundation personnel were present,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:53.680
including Security Agent William Berken. Worrying&nbsp;
that this was a potential security threat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:58.160
Agent Berken investigated the door to a&nbsp;
nearby closet. The second he opened it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.960
he was transported to the storefront of&nbsp;
Demon Dan’s Discount Homunculus Depot.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:08.560
He saw Demon Dan himself standing at the counter,&nbsp;
while four smaller, reptilian imps fought over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:14.480
a small flesh-suit. Demon Dan scolded them,&nbsp;
before turning his attention to Agent Berken.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:17.040
“Tsk, tsk, tsk. You aren't&nbsp;
supposed to be here, little man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:22.240
how naughty. I'm gonna have to have a word&nbsp;
with marketing– once I'm through with you.”

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:28.240
Agent Berken, fearing for his safety, drew&nbsp;
his weapon and shot Demon Dan three times.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:32.640
The creature dematerialized, before&nbsp;
appearing right next to Agent Berken,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:36.880
and disarming him with a swift chop.&nbsp;
The unfortunate security agent was then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:42.960
grabbed by the considerably larger Demon Dan, and&nbsp;
thrown over Dan’s shoulder. We know all of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:48.800
because Agent Berken’s standard-issue Foundation&nbsp;
body-camera recorded the whole terrifying ordeal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:54.880
even as Demon Dan dragged the helpless Berken&nbsp;
back into the twisted workshop behind the store.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:09:01.280
There, Berken saw what would soon be his own fate&nbsp;
right before his eyes - Dan’s minions converted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:07.760
human bodies into fleshy suits for their Demon&nbsp;
Clientele, and this unfortunate security officer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:14.960
was next. Dan gave him over to a pair of large,&nbsp;
sheep-like demons, and told them to “drain, skin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:19.360
and declaw him.” Berken’s video feed&nbsp;
finally cut as the demons pulled out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:24.720
their rusty tools and began to work on him.
Of course, the SCP Foundation wouldn’t take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:30.640
an attack on one of their operatives - inside&nbsp;
one of their facilities, no less - lying down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:34.320
The unfortunate death of William Berken&nbsp;
allowed the Foundation to refine their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:38.720
methods of intercepting the broadcast of&nbsp;
Demon Dan’s commercials. They even formed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:45.360
a new Mobile Task Force - Mobile Strike Force&nbsp;
Kappa-11, or the Baphomet Bashers - specifically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:50.800
to deal with Demon Dan and his cronies.
They did more than just prevent him from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:55.520
taking new humans, though. When the Baphomet&nbsp;
Bashers teamed up with an A-Class Clairvoyant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.520 --> 00:10:00.960
Entity to improve their efficiency in predicting&nbsp;
future broadcasts, they were able to launch sting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:06.400
operations, and arrest 21 different demonic&nbsp;
customers for interrogation. This impressive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:11.120
strike back finally gave the Foundation&nbsp;
some meaningful leverage over Demon Dan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:15.920
and through the use of their Clairvoyant Entity,&nbsp;
they were able to call a temporary truce and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:21.360
arrange a meeting with Demon Dan himself.
Captain Steiner, an agent of the Foundation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:27.040
External Negotiation Department, was the one to&nbsp;
interrogate Demon Dan. They sat across from each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:32.880
other at a table and Demon Dan was clearly tense,&nbsp;
frustrated with the way the Foundation had been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:37.840
messing with his business. All of their sting&nbsp;
operations were frightening off his customers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.920
In return for letting him continue his&nbsp;
work, the Foundation wanted Dan to turn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:47.040
over all the information on his bosses and&nbsp;
customers, allowing the Foundation to track&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.720
their movements. When Dan was evasive about&nbsp;
whether he’d comply, they tried threatening him.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:56.480
Dan laughed them off. “Go ahead–&nbsp;
take your best shot, little man!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.160
There's a dozen more just like&nbsp;
me, you won't stop anything.”

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:05.680
Finally, he was pressured into giving a yes&nbsp;
or no answer as to whether he’d willingly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:11.040
collaborate with the Foundation and act as&nbsp;
an informant against his kind. When Demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:17.120
Dan hinted that he may be willing to comply,&nbsp;
he began to make a horrifying gurgling noise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:23.040
and gripped his head in pain. He began speaking&nbsp;
in Latin in a voice that wasn’t his own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:27.840
as though the seven demon lords he served&nbsp;
were speaking through him. They said…

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:35.840
“You are a fool, Jailor. To think a pathetic&nbsp;
morsel such as this could aid you against us.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:40.080
I have allowed you to toil&nbsp;
in your own delusions for far&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:45.360
too long. You may have taken advantage&nbsp;
of Asmodeus all those years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:56.240
but you stop nothing. You hinder nothing! You&nbsp;
jail and barter to no avail. Your time is coming.”

00:11:56.240 --> 00:12:01.840
And then, Demon Dan’s head exploded - which&nbsp;
obviously prevented him from giving any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:07.920
incriminating information on those he worked for.&nbsp;
Whoever the demon lords are, they’re certainly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:13.600
the secretive type. You may think this is the&nbsp;
end of Demon Dan’s Discount Homunculus Depot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:20.320
and of SCP - 5049, but soon another ad&nbsp;
ran. It advertised the same products and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:24.720
services out of the same store. The&nbsp;
only difference was that, this time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:31.440
a different entity was starring in it.
Now go check out “SCP - 2662 - Cthulhu”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:37.840
and “SCP - 4000 - Taboo” for more strange&nbsp;
entities from the files of the SCP Foundation!

